# Keqing Furina Ororon Xianyun. ~21s Rot. Keqing Taser Plunge. Xianyun refreshes VV mid rotation. 4 plunges in each half. Ororon before Furina. Hold skill aerial plunge not implemented. 50% Collisons.

# Team
keqing char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
